  "description": "Eun-Hyeon has a special ability to talk to animals and thus has a job as a animal comunicator. One day, a man a a dog comes to him. The man says \"We will see each other often. See you next time.\" And as promised, the man becomes a daily customer. The love story about a man and a dog, and Eun-Hyeon who has to choose between them.\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
